Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Staging|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Staging|
	And Staging activate Staging CP
		|pageVersioningEnabled|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Event Repeat Daily
Priority: 4
	Given Staging add Event Repeat Daily
		|scheduleTitleName|Event Daily Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
Scenario: Add Page Variation
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Staging add Page Variation PG
		|pageVariationName|Page Variation Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Staging view Page Variation PG
		|pageVariationName|Page Variation Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Staging Test Page|
	And Page add Friendly URL Localized PG
		|friendlyUrlLocalized|de_DE|
		|localizedFriendlyURL|/german|
	And Page hide From Navigation Menu
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Staging Test Page|
	Then Page view Page Friendly URLPG
		|friendlyUrlLocalized|de_DE|
		|pageName|german|
Scenario: Add Page With Page Versioning Enabled
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Staging Page Versioning|
		|pageStaging|true|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Page Versioning|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Hello World|
	And Staging mark As Ready For Publication
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged View
	And Staging goto Publish To Live
	And Staging publish To Live
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Page Versioning|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Portlet view Specific PG
		|portletName|Hello World|
Scenario: Add Site Pages Variation
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Staging add Site Pages Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationName|Site Pages Variation Name|
	And Navigator goto Staged Site Page
		|pageName|Staging Test Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then Staging view Site Pages Variation PG
		|sitePagesVariationName|Site Pages Variation Name|